works.body:
Hello, 者委任具ハチナナさん! The works by 者委任具ハチナナさん are so noce to look at. If it's alright, I would love to request art of my child. 

He is in his late-30s. He has the air of a mature man. Please use a 柴犬 as reference for his ears (and tail if it can be seen). He has the round eyebrows. His hair should have gray streaks. He usually braids it as it is long. He has several scars from fighting. Feel free to place them where you like. 

He is a life-long soldier and very good at what he does. 

Despite his serious and grumpy face, he is surprisingly very kind to his friends and loved ones. He is a gentle person who likes small animals and flowers and reading. He enjoys teaching children. He is popular with children even if he doesn't understand why. He is クーデレ and has 萌え. He always has a sword at his waist.

He's associated with: 
紫陽花; 
ブーゲンビレア; 
wood carvings;
the stars;
sky blue; 
sunny days; 
swords.

Please draw freely in regards to expression and composition. 

Anything is OK! Please feel free to change his clothes!

Thank you for considering drawing my child! I look forward to working with 者委任具ハチナナさん!

